		},
		{
			"id": 7900403,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7900422
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7900402",
							"3"
						],
						"stepId": 7900402,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_FINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7900419",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7900419,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790040301,
					"content": "Well, we've recorded all these murals down. If we connect them, we should be able to put the pieces together.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7900404,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7900404
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7900404",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7900404,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Sayid"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790040401,
					"content": "Hmm. The contents depicted by these murals are not difficult to decipher in and of themselves. I cannot quite put them all in order yet, but I think there should be no problem if we just tried to understand them one by one.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040402,
					"content": "First, we have this mural, which depicts a group of people who were shipwrecked.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040403,
					"content": "After they were shipwrecked, they must have drifted to the island where you encountered the murals.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040404,
					"content": "They then stayed on that island.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040405,
					"content": "As for this mural, it shows five objects with five different markings within them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040406,
					"content": "Just like five cups filled with water, with each one containing a different amount of it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040407,
					"content": "This sort of artwork usually hints at a change in the state of something.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040414,
						790040415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040414,
					"content": "A change in state...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790040408,
					"content": "However, I cannot guess at what this \"something\" is exactly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040409,
					"content": "Still, if this is an island in the middle of the ocean, then this \"something\" could always be \"seawater.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040410,
					"content": "Next, let's look at this mural.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040411,
					"content": "After yet another shipwreck, this island welcomed some new \"guests.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040412,
					"content": "This should be the first batch of people attempting to rescue the second. Also, if you'll have a look at the wreckage depicted here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040413,
					"content": "The first mural only hints at their situation, but this mural goes into quite a lot of detail as to the wrecked ship.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040416,
					"content": "Perhaps this particular shipwreck meant something unusual to the people who wound up on this island.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040417,
					"content": "Then we come to this mural.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040418,
					"content": "Here, I'm sure you can observe that this mountain has been specially marked out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040419,
					"content": "I suspect that this place must have been important to these people.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040422,
					"content": "Finally, we come to this one. Clearly, they found some way to leave this island and thus departed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040423,
					"content": "The story the murals tell should be as such.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040424,
						790040428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040424,
					"content": "Thank you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790040425,
					"content": "It was nothing. In fact, I have always been quite interested in this sort of research.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040426,
					"content": "Thank you for bringing me this story and these murals. I never thought that I would encounter such things in Mondstadt.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040427,
					"content": "Perhaps I should take some time out to walk around outside...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040428,
					"content": "Why did they have to use murals, though?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040429
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790040429,
					"content": "Sometimes, images are more intuitive than language when it comes to recording and transmitting information.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Sayid"
				},
				{
					"id": 790040415,
					"content": "...What does that mean, exactly?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790040408
					]
				}
			]
		},
